	(text "UART series resistors are 1k: if the Orin is off, an idle-high TX can push at most ~3 mA into its header. Firmware also keeps TX quiet until it sees the Orin's TX idling high."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 54 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "0247357f-6705-5379-b40d-9dd9dfc5e80c")
	)
	(text "USB-C is for flashing and debug only (built-in USB-Serial/JTAG). VBUS only feeds the logic OR in aux_power."
